From b0cc7b4ec6f884a1e8921673a43f22878c8e96c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 15:23:25 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18: admit audited daily-use WebUI pages

Admit history, downloads, password-manager and extensions through one exact-host predicate shared by trusted navigation and the internal registration client. Keep privileged evaluation/capture denied and retain acknowledged HTTP script plans across WebUI visits. Disable browser-dependent Journeys without TabInterface; guard password shortcut, batch-upload and relaunch actions without a Browser. Keep flags rejected because its relaunch is outside the embedding lifecycle.

Advertise webui_daily_pages in ABI 1.14 / bridge 0.16.0 with unchanged ABI 1.13 structs and symbols. Builds p47/p48, the native WebUI handler host and all original native hosts, G1-G5 and four stress processes / sixteen shutdown tabs pass in gates-tab032.log.

Last rebased: 2026-11-03 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
